Explicitly requeue a terminal job with a bounded number of additional attempts

Usage: aws-inventory job retry [OPTIONS] --job-id <JOB_ID>

Options:
      --queue <QUEUE>                              [default: jobs.sqlite]
      --job-id <JOB_ID>                            
      --additional-attempts <ADDITIONAL_ATTEMPTS>  [default: 1]
  -h, --help                                       Print help
